   "title": "Calm, clear accounting for growing businesses",
   "content": "<!-- wp:group {\"anchor\":\"services\",\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-services\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div id=\"services\" class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-services\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">What we do</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Services for people and small businesses</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon-dot\"} --><p class=\"icon-dot\">Tx</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tax returns</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Personal and business returns, prepared by a CPA and reviewed by a second one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:tax}}\">Tips on tax returns &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon-dot\"} --><p class=\"icon-dot\">Bk</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bookkeeping</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Monthly books, bank reconciliations and a one-page report you can actually read.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:bookkeeping}}\">Tips on bookkeeping &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon-dot\"} --><p class=\"icon-dot\">Py</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Payroll</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Payroll, filings and year-end forms for teams of one to two hundred.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:payroll}}\">Tips on payroll &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"service-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group service-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"icon-dot\"} --><p class=\"icon-dot\">Ad</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advisory</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Cash-flow forecasts, pricing reviews and help preparing for a loan or investment.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"{{category:small-business}}\">Tips on advisory &rarr;</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-soft\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-soft\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\",\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center kicker\">Pricing</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center section-title\">Simple monthly plans</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} --><p class=\"has-text-align-center\">No hourly surprises. Every plan includes a free first call and a named accountant.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Personal</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$45<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Federal and state return</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Deduction review</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Year-round questions by email</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Choose plan</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan plan--featured\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan plan--featured\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small business</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$290<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Monthly bookkeeping</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Quarterly estimated taxes</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Business and owner returns</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A named accountant</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Most popular</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Growing team</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$640<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Everything in Small business</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Payroll for up to 25 people</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Quarterly advisory call</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Budget and forecast</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Choose plan</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"40%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:40%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Upcoming deadlines</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Never miss a filing date</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We send every client a reminder two weeks before each deadline that applies to them, and we file well before the last day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:tax-calendar}}\">Full tax calendar</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60%\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"deadline-table is-style-left\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table deadline-table is-style-left\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>What is due</th><th>Who</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Jan 15</td><td>Fourth-quarter estimated tax payment</td><td>Individuals, sole traders</td></tr><tr><td>Jan 31</td><td>Employee wage statements and contractor forms</td><td>Employers</td></tr><tr><td>Mar 15</td><td>Partnership and S-corporation returns</td><td>Partnerships, S-corps</td></tr><tr><td>Apr 15</td><td>Individual returns and first-quarter estimates</td><td>Individuals</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"className\":\"section-soft\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull section-soft\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"quote-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group quote-card\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Numera turned a shoebox of receipts into clean books in three weeks. Our loan application went through first time.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Owner of a family bakery</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"quote-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group quote-card\"><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>I finally understand my own payroll. The monthly one-page report is the best thing about them.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>Founder of a design studio</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">Finance tips</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"section-title\"} --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-title\">Plain answers to money questions</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:latest-posts {\"postsToShow\":3,\"displayPostDate\":true,\"postLayout\":\"grid\",\"columns\":3,\"displayPostContent\":true,\"excerptLength\":22} /--></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
