   "excerpt": "Fixed monthly fees, agreed in writing.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Three plans cover most of our clients. If yours is unusual, we will quote a fixed monthly fee after a free call.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Personal</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$45<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Federal and state return</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Deduction review</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Year-round questions by email</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Choose plan</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan plan--featured\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan plan--featured\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Small business</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$290<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Monthly bookkeeping</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Quarterly estimated taxes</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Business and owner returns</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A named accountant</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Most popular</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"plan\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group plan\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Growing team</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"price\"} --><p class=\"price\">$640<small> / month</small></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Everything in Small business</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Payroll for up to 25 people</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Quarterly advisory call</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Budget and forecast</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Choose plan</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Compare plans</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"compare-table\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table compare-table\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Personal</th><th>Small business</th><th>Growing team</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tax returns</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><td>Bookkeeping</td><td>–</td><td>Monthly</td><td>Monthly</td></tr><tr><td>Estimated taxes</td><td>Reminders</td><td>Calculated and filed</td><td>Calculated and filed</td></tr><tr><td>Payroll</td><td>–</td><td>Add-on</td><td>Up to 25 people</td></tr><tr><td>Advisory calls</td><td>–</td><td>Yearly</td><td>Quarterly</td></tr><tr><td>Response time</td><td>2 days</td><td>1 day</td><td>Same day</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>All prices exclude state filing fees. Annual billing saves one month.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
