  {
   "slug": "tax-calendar",
   "title": "Tax-deadline calendar",
   "excerpt": "Every key federal date for the year ahead.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">The key federal dates for the coming year. If a date falls on a weekend or holiday, the deadline moves to the next business day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:table {\"className\":\"deadline-table is-style-left\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-table deadline-table is-style-left\"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>What is due</th><th>Who it applies to</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Jan 15</td><td>Fourth-quarter estimated tax payment</td><td>Individuals, sole traders</td></tr><tr><td>Jan 31</td><td>Employee wage statements and contractor forms</td><td>Employers</td></tr><tr><td>Mar 15</td><td>Partnership and S-corporation returns</td><td>Partnerships, S-corps</td></tr><tr><td>Apr 15</td><td>Individual returns and first-quarter estimates</td><td>Individuals</td></tr><tr><td>Jun 15</td><td>Second-quarter estimated tax payment</td><td>Individuals, sole traders</td></tr><tr><td>Sep 15</td><td>Third-quarter estimates; extended business returns</td><td>Individuals, businesses</td></tr><tr><td>Oct 15</td><td>Extended individual returns</td><td>Individuals</td></tr><tr><td>Dec 31</td><td>Last day for most deductible contributions and gifts</td><td>Everyone</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Clients receive a personal reminder two weeks before each date that applies to them.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:table -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tips for a calm tax season</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"ticks\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list ticks\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Keep one folder, paper or digital, for every tax document as it arrives.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Schedule estimated payments in your bank on the day you file the previous one.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Send us your documents by the first of the month before a deadline.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tip-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tip-box\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Need an extension?</strong> An extension gives you more time to file, not more time to pay. We can estimate what you owe so you avoid penalties.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "menu_order": 2
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About Numera",
   "content": "<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":{{media_id:partners}},\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:partners}}\" alt=\"Two shapes meeting\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:partners}} size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accounting without the jargon</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Numera is a team of eleven accountants and tax advisers. We started in 2012 because we were tired of seeing small-business owners pay for advice they could not understand.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How we work</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"ticks\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list ticks\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Every client has one named accountant who knows their business.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We answer questions within one working day.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>We explain every number in plain language.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fixed monthly fees, agreed in writing.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Credentials</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Our partners are certified public accountants and enrolled agents, and every return is reviewed by a second accountant before it is filed.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "menu_order": 3
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Book a free call",
   "excerpt": "Twenty minutes, no obligation.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"lead\"} --><p class=\"lead\">Book a free 20-minute call. Tell us what you need and we will tell you which plan fits, or whether you need us at all.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Office</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>220 Orchard Avenue, Suite 5<br>Lakeview, LV3 7QP</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Mon–Fri 9:00–17:30<br>Saturdays in March and April</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Get in touch</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"tel:+15550168800\">+1 (555) 016-8800</a><br><a href=\"mailto:hello@numera.example\">hello@numera.example</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We reply within one working day.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"tip-box\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group tip-box\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><strong>Bring to your first meeting:</strong> last year's return, any letters from the tax office and a rough list of income and expenses.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
